<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav October wages rise 12.9 pct vs September.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav October wages rise 12.9 pct vs September.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV AVERAGE NET WAGES   OCT	  SEPT	OCT 1995</p>
<p> wage in dinars		   798	  707	  395.00</p>
<p> mth/mth percent change     + 12.9	+0.9	  + 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Data do not include private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
